<h1>Request awaiting your review</h1>
<p>
  <% if (@version&.version_number.to_i || 1) <= 1 %>
    A student submitted a new achievement request that needs your review.
  <% else %>
    A student resubmitted an achievement request after your feedback. Please review the updated version.
  <% end %>
</p>
<%= render "details" %>
